# Esc mid-turn in opencode, which takes two Escs to stop, while it writes a long answer: the turn
# is interrupted. One prompt, cut short.
agent opencode
recording opencode-esc
timeout 120
expect interrupted

wait-for start
sleep 3
type write the numbers from 1 to 300, one per line
press enter
wait-for prompt
sleep 3
press esc
sleep 0.3
press esc
wait-for idle
